tor","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and May to June and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle ran 60% of normal in October to November and 51% in November to December. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 188% of normal on the middle. Grid 13655 had its driest year in 1963 at 60%.</p>"}
